# TimeAndSale on a plain symbol is a stream: every event of the burst arrives, in the order of publishing, once.
scenario kit-stream-order
requires capability publisher

send endpoint e local_hub
send queue q e TimeAndSale
send subscribe q kit-stream-order.A kit-stream-order.END
send publish-burst e TimeAndSale kit-stream-order.A 1000
send publish e TimeAndSale event_symbol=kit-stream-order.END price=1
expect poll q 1000 limit=100 -> until kit-stream-order.END
  count kit-stream-order.A = 1000
  increasing kit-stream-order.A price
  last kit-stream-order.A price=1000
  dropped = 0
end
